2. Sum of Elements of a One-Dimensional Array
Problem Statement
Write a C program to accept the elements of a one-dimensional array and calculate the sum of
all its elements.
Program

#include <stdio.h>
int main()
{
int arr[100];
int n;
int i;
int sum = 0;
printf("Enter the number of elements: ");
scanf("%d", &n);
printf("Enter %d elements:\n", n);
for (i = 0; i < n; i++)
{
scanf("%d", &arr[i]);
sum = sum + arr[i];
}
printf("Sum of array elements = %d\n", sum);
return 0;
}
